change_type: instructions+code   changelog: Replaced imgbb with Cloudflare R2 presigned URLs (1 min expiry) for local image uploads. Added boto3 dependency. No longer requires imgbb API key.

### SKILL.md  [instructions]
- Two keys required — add both to `~/.openclaw/secrets.json`:
- | `/imgbb/apiKey` | Upload local images to public URLs (required for edit/video) | [api.imgbb.com](https://api.imgbb.com) |
- imgbb is used every time you pass a **local file** to an edit or video endpoint — RunPod endpoints only accept public URLs, so the image is temporarily uploaded to imgbb first.
- > ⚠️ **Privacy note:** Local images uploaded to imgbb become **publicly accessible URLs**. Do not pass private or sensitive images to edit/video commands.
- 2. **Env vars** — `RUNPOD_API_KEY`, `IMGBB_API_KEY`
+ One key required — add to `~/.openclaw/secrets.json`:
+ Local images are uploaded to **Cloudflare R2** as presigned URLs (1 min expiry) before being sent to RunPod endpoints. R2 credentials are read from `/cloudflare/r2` in secrets.json — already configured ✅
+ > imgbb is no longer used. R2 presigned URLs replace it for all local file uploads.
+ 2. **Env vars** — `RUNPOD_API_KEY`

